  "description": "If you’ve been looking for a fast e-bike that doesn’t scream E-Bike, the Fastlane 10 is your dream come true. Designed to be almost indiscernible from an analog racing bike, Fastlane 10 hides a TQ HPR40 motor drive unit and 290Wh battery in its svelte figure, leaving you fast under the radar.\n\nThe pintsize design (relative to other E-Bikes on the market) is thanks to German company TQ, who use a harmonic gear system to deliver a friendly 40Nm of pedal-assisted power in a hypersmooth, lifelike experience with almost zero drag or motor kickback. On a climb, the power supplied is a natural feeling, like your legs getting a second wind to reach the summit. On the flats, it glides you up to 25kmph before smoothly disengaging with almost no drag.\n\nHolding pace is what Fastlane is all about and trim frame lines and a lightweight 10kg build help to maximize battery life that outpaces heavier, bulkier e-bikes in its class. Mode selection is also discreet via controls on the hoods. We’ve equipped the Fastlane 10 with Shimano Ultegra Di2 electronic 2x gearing, versatile, aerodynamic Syncros Capital 1.0 40 wheels, and Schwalbe PRO ONE tires for speed and reliability wherever you ride.",
